WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:02.802
-Welcome to "The Tonight Show."
My name is Jimmy Fallon.

00:00:02.802 --> 00:00:03.836
And there's The Roots
right there.

00:00:03.836 --> 00:00:06.506
It's always good to see
The Roots.

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:09.242
Let's get to the news and jokes.

00:00:09.242 --> 00:00:11.878
Well, guys, this morning,
President Trump

00:00:11.878 --> 00:00:13.746
called into Fox Business
and spent

00:00:13.746 --> 00:00:16.582
the majority of the interview
attacking different women.

00:00:16.582 --> 00:00:17.650
Listen to this.

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:19.586 line:0%
-What is your reaction to
Kamala Harris?

00:00:19.586 --> 00:00:23.188 line:0%
-Now you have sort of
a mad woman, I call her.

00:00:23.188 --> 00:00:25.358 line:0%
"AOC" was a poor student.

00:00:25.358 --> 00:00:27.126 line:0%
This is not even a smart person.

00:00:27.126 --> 00:00:30.129 line:0%
I mean,
she goes out and she yaps.

00:00:30.129 --> 00:00:33.133 line:0%
Nancy Pelosi is
stone-cold crazy.

00:00:33.133 --> 00:00:36.135
-Man. Looks like someone woke up

00:00:36.135 --> 00:00:39.338
on the wrong side
of the MyPillow.

00:00:39.338 --> 00:00:42.608
Mad woman, not smart,
and stone-cold crazy.

00:00:42.608 --> 00:00:45.345
Yeah, he's tough on the phone,
but if he really had guts,

00:00:45.345 --> 00:00:48.781
he'd say all of that on
"The View."

00:00:48.781 --> 00:00:52.218
And just to drop a cherry
on top of the misogyny sundae,

00:00:52.218 --> 00:00:54.487
Trump also sent a tweet calling

00:00:54.487 --> 00:00:58.558
"Morning Joe's" Mika Brzezinski
a "ditzy airhead."

00:00:58.558 --> 00:01:00.592
Seriously,
if you had a co-worker

00:01:00.592 --> 00:01:02.829
who came in and said that kind
of stuff about women,

00:01:02.829 --> 00:01:04.831
they wouldn't be your co-worker
by the end of the day.

00:01:04.831 --> 00:01:06.633
It's like, "Alright,
I've insulted everyone here.

00:01:06.633 --> 00:01:09.669
I'm just going to get my coat.
See myself out."

00:01:09.669 --> 00:01:12.205
At this point, our best shot
at Trump attacking COVID

00:01:12.205 --> 00:01:15.175
is someone telling him
the virus ovulates.

00:01:19.311 --> 00:01:20.780
If the election
doesn't work out,

00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:21.881
Trump can always get a job

00:01:21.881 --> 00:01:24.216
as the worst Hallmark card
writer ever.

00:01:24.216 --> 00:01:25.484
[ As Trump ]
Happy Valentine's Day

00:01:25.484 --> 00:01:26.919
to my suburban housewife.

00:01:26.919 --> 00:01:29.922
Please don't become a cold-stone
crazy, ditzy, mad woman

00:01:29.922 --> 00:01:32.792
who goes out and yaps.

00:01:32.792 --> 00:01:35.094
[ Normal voice ] Right now, AOC
is like, "I double-majored

00:01:35.094 --> 00:01:37.330
in economics and
international relations.

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:41.734
You double-majored
in elephants and lunch."

00:01:41.734 --> 00:01:43.970
Well, despite all that, the
president's campaign

00:01:43.970 --> 00:01:47.406
now has a Women for Trump bus
that's traveling the country.

00:01:47.406 --> 00:01:50.443
Look at this thing.

00:01:50.443 --> 00:01:53.112
Fun fact -- that's actually
the old "Access Hollywood" bus

00:01:53.112 --> 00:01:54.680
with a new paint job.

00:01:54.680 --> 00:01:59.118
Come on.

00:01:59.118 --> 00:02:00.820
Meanwhile,
the Wienermobile saw that

00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:04.323
and was like, "Well, hello!"

00:02:04.323 --> 00:02:06.893
Also in his interview,
Trump discussed how Democrats

00:02:06.893 --> 00:02:09.028
want funding for
the Postal Service,

00:02:09.028 --> 00:02:10.329
and he said something
kind of alarming.

00:02:10.329 --> 00:02:11.697
Listen to this.

00:02:11.697 --> 00:02:16.569 line:0%
-They want $25 billion --
billion -- for the Post Office.

00:02:16.569 --> 00:02:18.204 line:0%
Now, they need that money
in order to have

00:02:18.204 --> 00:02:19.839 line:0%
the Post Office work
so it can take

00:02:19.839 --> 00:02:22.308 line:0%
all of these millions
and millions of ballots.

00:02:22.308 --> 00:02:24.443 line:0%
If we don't make a deal, that
means they don't get the money.

00:02:24.443 --> 00:02:27.980 line:0%
That means they can't
have universal mail-in voting.

00:02:27.980 --> 00:02:30.349 line:0%
They just can't have it.

00:02:30.349 --> 00:02:33.986
-Okay. He just admitted
that he's not agreeing to a deal

00:02:33.986 --> 00:02:36.222
to fund the Postal Service
because he doesn't want

00:02:36.222 --> 00:02:39.625
mail-in voting to
be possible for the election.

00:02:39.625 --> 00:02:42.061
Trump is like one of those movie
villains who spends so much time

00:02:42.061 --> 00:02:44.097
explaining his plan out loud
that the good guy

00:02:44.097 --> 00:02:46.833
manages to shimmy out
of his handcuffs.

00:02:46.833 --> 00:02:48.200
[ As Trump ] First,
I'm going to take your body,

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:50.169
and I'm going to put you
in the piranha tank.

00:02:50.169 --> 00:02:52.205
Then I'm going to get
a buzz saw,

00:02:52.205 --> 00:02:54.440
and the buzz saw's
slowly gonna come.

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:59.178
Right then, the -- He's gone.

00:02:59.178 --> 00:03:00.212
[ Normal voice ]
Postal workers were like,

00:03:00.212 --> 00:03:02.014
"How much less funding
can you give us?

00:03:02.014 --> 00:03:06.519
We don't even have pants."

00:03:06.519 --> 00:03:07.954
No one is happy about this.

00:03:07.954 --> 00:03:10.456
Millions of Americans wrote
Trump angry letters about it,

00:03:10.456 --> 00:03:11.457
but he was like, "Weird.

00:03:11.457 --> 00:03:15.728
I didn't get anything."

00:03:15.728 --> 00:03:16.930
But this is nice.

00:03:16.930 --> 00:03:18.364
When he found out Trump
was meddling

00:03:18.364 --> 00:03:21.234
in the election himself,
Putin was like,

00:03:21.234 --> 00:03:24.704
"They grow up so fast."

00:03:24.704 --> 00:03:26.372
Speaking of the election,
after Joe Biden

00:03:26.372 --> 00:03:28.907
announced that Kamala Harris
was his V.P. pick,

00:03:28.907 --> 00:03:31.510
the Trump campaign was quick to
release an official statement.

00:03:31.510 --> 00:03:33.112
Yeah, it seems like they
can't make up their mind

00:03:33.112 --> 00:03:34.547
about how to criticize her.

00:03:34.547 --> 00:03:35.815
Check out this ad.

00:03:35.815 --> 00:03:37.550 line:0%
-Hey, Progressives,
do you really want

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:40.653 line:0%
Kamala "Tough on Crime" Harris
as your V.P.?

00:03:40.653 --> 00:03:42.054 line:0%
We didn't think so.

00:03:42.054 --> 00:03:43.989 line:0%
And, hey, Moderates,
do you really want

00:03:43.989 --> 00:03:47.159 line:0%
Kamala "Not Tough Enough
on Crime" Harris as your V.P.?

00:03:47.159 --> 00:03:49.028 line:0%
We didn't think so either.

00:03:49.028 --> 00:03:52.231 line:0%
Look, here's the truth --
Kamala Harris is a radical.

00:03:52.231 --> 00:03:53.799 line:0%
Sorry if that triggers you.

00:03:53.799 --> 00:03:57.169 line:0%
But, at the very same time,
she's not nearly radical enough.

00:03:57.169 --> 00:03:58.638 line:0%
Double-triggered much?

00:03:58.638 --> 00:04:00.706 line:0%
Kamala loves unicorns,
but she hates horses

00:04:00.706 --> 00:04:02.475 line:0%
with horning growing out
of their head.

00:04:02.475 --> 00:04:03.943 line:0%
She thinks kittens are cute,

00:04:03.943 --> 00:04:06.445 line:0%
but she thinks that baby cats
are overrated.

00:04:06.445 --> 00:04:07.613 line:0%
She is the yin
and she is the yang.

00:04:07.613 --> 00:04:08.981 line:0%
She is anti and she is pro.

00:04:08.981 --> 00:04:10.216 line:0%
She is yes and she is no.

00:04:10.216 --> 00:04:14.319 line:0%
She is boooooring and she is,
yowza, too spicy!

00:04:14.319 --> 00:04:16.222 line:0%
Bottom line -- Kamala Harris is

00:04:16.222 --> 00:04:19.124 line:0%
too extreme and/or
not extreme enough.

00:04:19.124 --> 00:04:20.726 line:0%
This ad brought to you by
the Trump Campaign

00:04:20.726 --> 00:04:23.363 line:0%
For Non-Self
Conflicting Messages.

00:04:23.363 --> 00:04:25.932
-It was just hard to understand.

00:04:25.932 --> 00:04:27.767
Well, even though Trump's
spending his time

00:04:27.767 --> 00:04:29.835
calling into Fox,
I'm sure his administration

00:04:29.835 --> 00:04:33.171
is focused on the important
issues facing our nation, right?

00:04:33.171 --> 00:04:35.975 line:0%
-The Trump administration wants
to change the definition

00:04:35.975 --> 00:04:38.711 line:0%
of a shower head
to let more water flow.

00:04:38.711 --> 00:04:40.246 line:0%
President Trump
talked about the need

00:04:40.246 --> 00:04:43.549 line:0%
to keep his hair perfect
and complained multiple times

00:04:43.549 --> 00:04:45.418 line:0%
that he was not getting
wet enough.

00:04:45.418 --> 00:04:48.253
[ Laughter ]

00:04:48.253 --> 00:04:53.726
♪♪
-No. Wow!

00:04:53.726 --> 00:04:55.995
-Wow! First of all,
I just want to apologize

00:04:55.995 --> 00:04:58.931
for making everyone picture
Trump in the shower.

00:04:58.931 --> 00:05:01.234
Even more upsetting,
he took our top scientists

00:05:01.234 --> 00:05:04.737
off vaccine research
and put them on this.

00:05:04.737 --> 00:05:09.141
He's not getting wet enough
in the shower?

00:05:09.141 --> 00:05:11.043
Meanwhile, Americans were like,
"Shower heads?

00:05:11.043 --> 00:05:14.180
We haven't bathed
in five months."

00:05:14.180 --> 00:05:15.514
Let's get to some business news.

00:05:15.514 --> 00:05:18.183
As movie theaters across
the country attempt to reopen,

00:05:18.183 --> 00:05:20.619
AMC has come up with a way
to bring customers back.

00:05:20.619 --> 00:05:21.954
Listen to this.

00:05:21.954 --> 00:05:24.923 line:0%
-AMC has announced that it is
reopening its theaters

00:05:24.923 --> 00:05:29.796 line:0%
next week, and tickets will be
just 15 cents on reopening day.

00:05:33.365 --> 00:05:36.302
-Yep. For 15 cents,
you can spend two hours

00:05:36.302 --> 00:05:41.307
in full panic,
wondering if it was worth it.

00:05:41.307 --> 00:05:46.179
Should I be doing this?

00:05:46.179 --> 00:05:49.515
-Who has a dime and a nickel?
-Yeah, that too.

00:05:49.515 --> 00:05:50.983
When they heard that,
old people were like,

00:05:50.983 --> 00:05:52.051
"We're going to go to
the matinee

00:05:52.051 --> 00:05:55.354
because it only costs
a dime," yeah.

00:05:55.354 --> 00:05:58.157
-The original what?
The nickelodeon.

00:05:58.157 --> 00:06:00.125
-Yeah, exactly.
That's exactly what it is.

00:06:00.125 --> 00:06:03.162
They go, "Is this worth it?
Should I be..."

00:06:03.162 --> 00:06:04.596
All it takes is
one person to go...

00:06:04.596 --> 00:06:05.698
[ Coughs ]
...and you're like, "I'm out."

00:06:05.698 --> 00:06:07.666
Okay, that's it.
I'm good. I'm good.

00:06:07.666 --> 00:06:09.835
What am I doing?"

00:06:09.835 --> 00:06:13.339
In more serious news,
I saw that Pringles is now...

00:06:13.339 --> 00:06:19.011
[ Laughter ]

00:06:19.011 --> 00:06:21.613
I saw that Pringles is now
selling a chip that tastes like

00:06:21.613 --> 00:06:24.250
a Wendy's Baconator,
and they want people

00:06:24.250 --> 00:06:27.119
to dip them in Frostys,
in their milkshakes.

00:06:27.119 --> 00:06:29.355
Take a look at these things.
Yeah.

00:06:29.355 --> 00:06:31.690
They're actually trying out
some new slogans.

00:06:31.690 --> 00:06:32.925
Check it out.
First, there's...

00:06:37.263 --> 00:06:38.765 line:0%
Next, there's...

00:06:44.336 --> 00:06:45.371
Then there's...

00:06:49.575 --> 00:06:51.177 line:0%
Next, there's...

00:06:54.713 --> 00:06:56.649 line:0%
And, finally...

00:06:58.216 --> 00:07:01.019
So just be careful when
you're...

00:07:01.019 --> 00:07:02.688
And, finally,
this is going viral.

00:07:02.688 --> 00:07:08.260
This "skinny house" in Illinois
was just sold for $260,000.

00:07:08.260 --> 00:07:11.297
Check this thing out.
Look at this. Look at that.

00:07:11.297 --> 00:07:14.934
Can we see it again?
Put it up again.

00:07:14.934 --> 00:07:18.303
Yeah. It's a skinny house. Yeah.

00:07:18.303 --> 00:07:20.072
When you put your mail
through the front slot,

00:07:20.072 --> 00:07:22.775
it just flies out the back.

00:07:22.775 --> 00:07:24.377
That house is
the only thing in America

00:07:24.377 --> 00:07:27.146
that stayed skinny
during quarantine.

00:07:27.146 --> 00:07:29.314
Right now, every other house
on the block is like, "Wait.

00:07:29.314 --> 00:07:31.249
Am I fat?"

00:07:31.249 --> 00:07:33.986
Yep, the size of the house
is just 3 feet wide,

00:07:33.986 --> 00:07:36.255
whereas New Yorkers
call that a palace.

00:07:36.255 --> 00:07:37.723
Ah!

